# homelab-node-exporter configuration.
#
# Space- and/or comma-separated IP address(es) or CIDR(s) of the
# monitoring host(s) allowed to scrape THIS host's Prometheus exporter
# ports (node_exporter :9100 and any other homelab exporter on this
# host). Used on package configure to generate
# /etc/nftables.d/10-homelab-metrics.nft. Defaults to the fleet
# monitoring host (ct19). Edit + `dpkg-reconfigure homelab-node-exporter`
# (or reinstall) to change.
MONITORING_HOSTS="10.50.2.63"
